{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Atlanta Streets Dark",
  "id": "atlanta-streets-dark",
  "metadata": {
    "peregrine:note": "Atlanta Streets recoloured for a dark display: the same layers, filters and widths, with a charcoal ground, dark blue water and dark green parks. The riding tiers keep their hues, brightened to read on the dark ground. Generated by port/tools/make_atlanta_dark_style.py; edit the palette there.",
    "peregrine:bike-tiers": "Casing colour by tier: trail #34c26a; signed route #3fb56a; quiet #5e8a69; moderate #d19a2a; busy #d06c2e; avoid #c23b35; no bicycles #8a8592; interstate #8378c9.",
    "peregrine:palette": "Land #2b2d30, water #2f4a6b, park #2f4d2e, golf #303a2f, wood #26332a, building #3a3835, parking #333436, rail #77736d, state line #7d7499.",
    "peregrine:derived-from": "atlanta-streets.json"
  },
  "sources": {
    "openmaptiles": {
      "type": "vector"
    }
  },
  "sprite": "symbols/osm-liberty-topo",
  "layers": [
    {"id": "background", "type": "background", "paint": {"background-color": "#2b2d30"}},
    {"id": "wood", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "filter": ["==", "class", "wood"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#26332a"}},
    {"id": "grass", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "minzoom": 11, "filter": ["all", ["==", "class", "grass"], ["!in", "subclass", "park", "golf_course", "recreation_ground", "garden"]], "paint": {"fill-color": "#2c3a2c"}},
    {"id": "wetland", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "filter": ["==", "class", "wetland"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#2b3830"}},
    {"_comment": "Golf is ground, not a destination: a pale fill a step off the land colour, never the park green.", "id": "golf-course", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "minzoom": 11, "filter": ["==", "subclass", "golf_course"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#303a2f", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[11, "#303a2f"], [14, "#3c4a3a"]]}}},
    {"id": "nature-reserve", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "park", "filter": ["==", "$type", "Polygon"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#2a3d2c", "fill-outline-color": "#3f5c3f"}},
    {"_comment": "Parks are the city's landmarks and its quiet routes: the strongest ground colour, outlined once the edge can be told from a street.", "id": "park", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "filter": ["in", "subclass", "park", "recreation_ground", "garden"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#2f4d2e", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[10, "#2f4d2e"], [13, "#4d7a45"]]}}},
    {"id": "cemetery", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 11, "filter": ["==", "class", "cemetery"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#2f382e"}},
    {"id": "campus", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["in", "class", "university", "college", "school"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#36332e"}},
    {"id": "hospital", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["==", "class", "hospital"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#3d2f2f"}},
    {"id": "pitch", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 15, "filter": ["==", "class", "pitch"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#34502f", "fill-outline-color": "#4a6a42"}},
    {"_comment": "Surface lots cover much of the city; drawn only close in, and barely off the land colour.", "id": "parking", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 15.5, "filter": ["==", "class", "parking"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#333436", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[15.5, "#333436"], [17, "#434346"]]}}},
    {"id": "water", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "water", "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Polygon"], ["!=", "class", "swimming_pool"]], "paint": {"fill-color": "#2f4a6b"}},
    {"id": "pool", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "water", "minzoom": 16, "filter": ["==", "class", "swimming_pool"], "paint": {"fill-color": "#3d5a8f", "fill-outline-color": "#5373a8"}},
    {"id": "river", "type": "line", "source-layer": "waterway", "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "river", "canal"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#3a5a85", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[8, 0.6], [12, 1.4], [16, 4], [19, 8]]}}},
    {"_comment": "Creeks and ditches are thin until they could be mistaken for nothing else.", "id": "stream", "type": "line", "source-layer": "waterway", "minzoom": 13, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["!in", "class", "river", "canal"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#34506f", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[13, 0.4], [16, 1.2], [19, 2.5]]}}},
    {"id": "boundary-county", "type": "line", "source-layer": "boundary", "minzoom": 8.5, "maxzoom": 13, "filter": ["==", "admin_level", 6], "paint": {"line-color": "#4f4a5e", "line-width": {"stops": [[8.5, 0.6], [13, 1]]}, "line-dasharray": [3, 2]}},
    {"id": "boundary-state", "type": "line", "source-layer": "boundary", "filter": ["==", "admin_level", 4], "paint": {"line-color": "#7d7499", "line-width": {"stops": [[3, 0.7], [7, 1.4], [12, 2.2]]}, "line-dasharray": [4, 2]}},
    {"id": "boundary-country", "type": "line", "source-layer": "boundary", "filter": ["==", "admin_level", 2], "paint": {"line-color": "#948bb3", "line-width": {"stops": [[0, 0.8], [6, 1.6], [12, 2.6]]}}},
    {"id": "building", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "building", "minzoom": 14.5, "paint": {"fill-color": "#3a3835", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[14.5, "#3a3835"], [15.5, "#57534e"]]}}},
    {"id": "aeroway-runway", "type": "line", "source-layer": "aeroway", "minzoom": 11, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "runway"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#45434d", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[11, 1], [14, 6], [17, 30]]}}},
    {"id": "rail", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 10, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "rail", "transit"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#77736d", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[10, 0.6], [14, 1.6], [18, 3]]}}},
    {"id": "rail-hatch", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "rail", "transit"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#2b2d30", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[14, 0.6], [18, 1.6]]}, "line-dasharray": [3, 3]}},
    {"id": "rail-tunnel", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "rail", "transit"], ["==", "brunnel", "tunnel"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#55524e", "line-width": {"stops": [[13, 0.8], [18, 2]]}, "line-dasharray": [2, 2]}},
    {"_comment": "Casings carry the tier colour and are drawn below every fill, so junctions stay whole. Below the zoom where a fill starts, the casing alone is the road.", "id": "road-driveway-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#3d3b38", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[16.5, 2], [19, 6]]}}},
    {"id": "road-service-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["!in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#4d6b55", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[14, 1], [16, 3], [19, 9]]}}},
    {"id": "road-quiet-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "minor"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#5e8a69", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 0.7], [13, 1.5], [14, 2.4], [16, 5.5], [19, 16]]}}},
    {"id": "road-moderate-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 11, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "tertiary"]], "paint": {"line-color": {"stops": [[11, "#6b6150"], [12, "#d19a2a"]]}, "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[11, 0.7], [13, 3], [16, 8], [19, 20]]}}},
    {"id": "road-busy-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 9, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "secondary"]], "paint": {"line-color": {"stops": [[9, "#6a5b4a"], [11, "#d06c2e"]]}, "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[9, 0.6], [11, 1.6], [13, 3.5], [16, 9], [19, 22]]}}},
    {"id": "road-avoid-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 7, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk"]], "paint": {"line-color": {"stops": [[7, "#5f5246"], [10, "#c23b35"]]}, "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[7, 0.5], [9, 1], [11, 2], [13, 4], [16, 10], [19, 24]]}}},
    {"id": "road-nobike-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk", "secondary", "tertiary", "minor", "service"], ["==", "bicycle", "no"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#8a8592", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 1], [13, 3.5], [16, 9], [19, 22]]}}},
    {"id": "road-signed-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk", "secondary", "tertiary", "minor", "service"], ["==", "bicycle", "designated"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#3fb56a", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 1], [13, 3.5], [16, 9], [19, 22]]}}},
    {"_comment": "Interstates are drawn from z5 as orientation landmarks: indigo, the one hue no riding tier uses.", "id": "road-interstate-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "motorway"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#8378c9", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[5, 1.2], [8, 2.2], [10, 3.2], [13, 6], [16, 13], [19, 30]]}}},
    {"id": "road-driveway", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#46443f", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[16.5, 1], [19, 4]]}}},
    {"id": "road-service", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["!in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#55534f", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[14, 0.5], [16, 1.8], [19, 7]]}}},
    {"id": "road-quiet", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "minor"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#5c5a55", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[13.5, 0.7], [14, 1.1], [16, 3.8], [19, 13]]}}},
    {"id": "road-moderate", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "tertiary"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#665f50", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12.5, 0.8], [13, 1.8], [16, 5.5], [19, 16]]}}},
    {"id": "road-busy", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "secondary"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#68594c", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 0.8], [13, 2.2], [16, 6.5], [19, 18]]}}},
    {"id": "road-avoid", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#6a4f4b", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 1], [13, 2.6], [16, 7.5], [19, 20]]}}},
    {"id": "road-interstate", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 8.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "motorway"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#6a4f4b", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[8.5, 0.8], [10, 1.8], [13, 4], [16, 10], [19, 26]]}}},
    {"_comment": "Draws only on tiles whose profile writes `cycleway` (lane, buffered_lane, shared_lane, track); today's peregrine profile does not, and the layer is then empty.", "id": "bike-lane", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "cycleway", "lane", "buffered_lane", "track", "separate", "opposite_lane", "opposite_track"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#3fb56a", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[13, 0.8], [16, 2], [19, 4]]}, "line-dasharray": [3, 1.5]}},
    {"id": "track", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "track"], ["!in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#97805a", "line-width": {"stops": [[13, 0.8], [18, 2.5]]}, "line-dasharray": [3, 2]}},
    {"_comment": "Sidewalks and crossings are class=path subclass=footway. They cannot be ridden here, so they wait until the map is close enough to show a block's edge.", "id": "sidewalk", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["in", "subclass", "footway", "pedestrian"], ["!in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"], ["!has", "golf"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#7a7067", "line-width": {"stops": [[16.5, 0.6], [19, 1.8]]}, "line-dasharray": [2, 1.5]}},
    {"id": "steps", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["==", "subclass", "steps"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#c47a5e", "line-width": {"stops": [[16, 2], [19, 5]]}, "line-dasharray": [0.4, 0.4]}},
    {"_comment": "Walking trails: generic paths and bridleways that do not admit bicycles. Unlike sidewalks they run through parks and are worth seeing from z14.", "id": "walk", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["in", "subclass", "path", "bridleway"], ["!in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"], ["!has", "golf"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#c98b64", "line-width": {"base": 1.3, "stops": [[14, 0.8], [16, 1.6], [19, 3.5]]}, "line-dasharray": [2.5, 1.5]}},
    {"_comment": "Trails: highway=cycleway, and any path or track that admits bicycles. The strongest line on the map; a pale core from z14, dashed where unpaved.", "id": "trail-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 10.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "path", "track"], ["any", ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"], ["in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]], ["!in", "surface", "unpaved", "gravel", "fine_gravel", "compacted", "dirt", "earth", "ground", "grass", "mud", "sand", "woodchips"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#34c26a", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[10.5, 0.8], [13, 2], [16, 4.5], [19, 9]]}}},
    {"id": "trail-unpaved", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "path", "track"], ["any", ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"], ["in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]], ["in", "surface", "unpaved", "gravel", "fine_gravel", "compacted", "dirt", "earth", "ground", "grass", "mud", "sand", "woodchips"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#8dbb4f", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[12, 1], [16, 3], [19, 6]]}, "line-dasharray": [2, 1]}},
    {"id": "trail", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "path", "track"], ["any", ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"], ["in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]], ["!in", "surface", "unpaved", "gravel", "fine_gravel", "compacted", "dirt", "earth", "ground", "grass", "mud", "sand", "woodchips"]], "paint": {"line-color": "#1d3b27", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[14, 0.8], [16, 2], [19, 4.5]]}}},
    {"id": "barrier", "type": "circle", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 17, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "class", "barrier"]], "paint": {"circle-color": "#bdb2a4", "circle-radius": {"stops": [[17, 2], [19, 3.5]]}}},
    {"id": "water-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "water_name", "minzoom": 14, "filter": ["==", "$type", "Point"], "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "text-size": 10.5}, "paint": {"text-color": "#93b3e6", "text-halo-color": "#1d2744", "text-halo-width": 1.2}},
    {"id": "river-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "waterway", "minzoom": 12, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "river"]], "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 500, "text-size": {"stops": [[12, 10], [16, 12.5]]}}, "paint": {"text-color": "#93b3e6", "text-halo-color": "#1d2744", "text-halo-width": 1.2}},
    {"id": "road-name-minor", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 15.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "minor", "service"]], "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 350, "text-size": {"stops": [[15.5, 9.5], [19, 13]]}}, "paint": {"text-color": "#e6e1d9", "text-halo-color": "#2b2d30", "text-halo-width": 1.5}},
    {"id": "road-name-major", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 13.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "tertiary", "secondary", "primary", "trunk"]], "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 450, "text-size": {"stops": [[13.5, 10], [16, 11.5], [19, 15]]}}, "paint": {"text-color": "#f5f1ea", "text-halo-color": "#1f2023", "text-halo-width": 1.8}},
    {"id": "trail-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 13.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"]], "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 400, "text-offset": [0, 0.9], "text-size": {"stops": [[13.5, 10], [16, 11.5], [19, 13]]}}, "paint": {"text-color": "#8fe0a8", "text-halo-color": "#1b2a1f", "text-halo-width": 1.7}},
    {"id": "path-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["!=", "subclass", "cycleway"]], "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 300, "text-offset": [0, 0.9], "text-size": {"stops": [[16.5, 9.5], [19, 12]]}}, "paint": {"text-color": "#dba584", "text-halo-color": "#1f2023", "text-halo-width": 1.5}},
    {"_comment": "Route numbers in white on an indigo halo read as a shield; the sheet has no shield artwork.", "id": "interstate-ref", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 8, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "motorway"]], "layout": {"text-field": "{ref}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 500, "text-size": {"stops": [[8, 9.5], [12, 11], [16, 13]]}}, "paint": {"text-color": "#ffffff", "text-halo-color": "#463f7a", "text-halo-width": 2.4}},
    {"_comment": "Lodging, parking and food share z16.5 so all three are on a phone's map by 1:5,000.", "id": "poi-lodging", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "class", "lodging"]], "layout": {"icon-image": "lodging_11", "text-field": "{name:latin}", "text-size": 10, "text-anchor": "top", "text-offset": [0, 0.9]}, "paint": {"text-color": "#cbbfb0", "text-halo-color": "#1f2023", "text-halo-width": 1.3}},
    {"id": "poi-parking", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "subclass", "parking"]], "layout": {"icon-image": "parking_11"}},
    {"id": "poi-small", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 17, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["in", "subclass", "playground", "tennis", "dog_park"]], "layout": {"icon-image": "{subclass}_11"}},
    {"id": "poi-worship", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 17, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "class", "place_of_worship"]], "layout": {"icon-image": "place_of_worship_11"}},
    {"id": "poi-toilets", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 16.5, "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "subclass", "toilets"]], "layout": {"icon-image": "toilet_11"}},
